The MIT license applies ONLY to the analysis code in this repository. The
mortality and population data processed by this code originate from third
parties and remain governed by their own terms of use:

  * Human Mortality Database (mortality.org) — free for research use after
    registration; REDISTRIBUTION IS NOT PERMITTED. HMD source files are NOT
    included in this repository. See docs/data_sources.md to obtain them.
  * Eurostat, CDC WONDER, Statistics Canada, UK ONS, Statistics Korea, and
    other national statistical offices — each under its own license/terms.

The single processed file data/master_5x1_DPM_90plus.csv that IS vendored here
is a derived, aggregated analytic dataset (deaths, exposures and rates by
5-year age band, year and country). It is provided to make the analysis
reproducible; users redistributing or reusing it must observe the upstream
providers' terms, in particular the HMD user agreement.
